  "body": "Located in the peaceful Ara Hills with elevated sea views, this brand-new family home offers great value, comfort, and practical living. It provides an exciting opportunity to secure a beautiful home and a relaxed coastal lifestyle in a\r\nfantastic, growing community.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n\r\n• 5 Bedrooms & 2.5 Bathrooms: This includes a master bedroom with its own private ensuite, a full family bathroom, and an extra separate toilet to handle the morning rush.\r\n\r\n• Separate Lounge: A dedicated living lounge right by the entrance, perfect for a media room, kid play area, or a quiet space to chat with guests.\r\n\r\n• Open-Plan Living: The main kitchen, dining, and living area is full of natural light, capturing the beautiful sea views and creating a great hub for everyday life.\r\n\r\n• Modern Kitchen: Comes with an island bench, quality appliances, and plenty of storage.\r\n\r\n• Premium Comfort: Features a double garage and a central air conditioning unit for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nAra Hills is a highly sought-after area, just minutes away from local schools, Orewa Beach, cafes, walkways, and Silverdale shopping. Easy motorway access makes daily commuting simple, while weekends can be spent enjoying the beaches, parks, and coastal lifestyle nearby. Contact us today for your private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
